+# Problems
+
+## Memba staff identity and club access
+
+Observed: 2026-06-01
+
+While reviewing problem-domain terms, we clarified that “Memba staff” is the product term for people currently using the Memba staff area. Two related product questions remain unresolved and should be explored when staff access needs more precise behaviour.
+
+Open questions:
+
+- Can Memba staff access member-only club areas without also being club members?
+- Are Memba staff represented as person records, identified by email domain, or both?
